@startuml agent-multi-infoflow
title agent-multi — information flow (who feeds whom, per round)
skinparam participantPadding 5
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Human" as H
participant "Game Engine\n+ sidecar :8302" as GAME
participant "LLM servers\n:9931..:9934" as LLM
participant "Strategist" as S
participant "Economist" as E
participant "Analyst" as A
participant "Critic" as C
participant "strategist.json\neconomist.json\nanalyst.json\ncritic.json" as FS
participant "COMMANDER\n(4B executor)" as CMD
database "orders.json" as ORD

== continuously, each at its own pace ==

GAME -> S : observe (full snapshot)
LLM  -> S : plan (research path,\nfleet comp, attack timing)
S -> FS : strategist.json\n{directives}

GAME -> E : observe + techTree
LLM  -> E : production plan (build q, harvest routes)
E -> FS : economist.json {buildQueue, directives}

GAME -> A : observe (compressed) + fresh events
LLM  -> A : threat reactions
A -> FS : analyst.json {reactions}

FS  -> C : strategist/economist artifacts\n+ orders.json
GAME -> C : compressed snapshot + events (critic cycle)
LLM  -> C : objections
C -> FS : critic.json {objections, advice}

== every ~1s: commander round (sole binder/orderer) ==

GAME -> CMD : observe + get_events
FS  -> CMD : read all 4 artifacts\n(drop stale > 60s) - zero LLM cost
CMD -> LLM : executor prompt + peer directives\n+ snapshot (1 round, 1 tool call)
LLM -> CMD : order_* / save_game
CMD -> GAME : enforce: builds queued / no idle ships /\nresearch in progress
CMD -> ORD : append order ring
ORD -> C : (next critic cycle)

CMD --> H : game window + /tmp/aiplay-agent.log
@enduml